Hello there,

We're hard at work on new content, but today we're pushing out a small update of bug fixes. Enjoy! Changelog is below.

As always, if you have any issues please contact us via [url=https://www.ndemiccreations.com/en/1-support]our website[/url] or [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/246620/discussions/5/492379159718540524/]the steam forums.[/url]

[b]Change Log[/b]
- Updated achievement unlocking system and logging.
- Fixed: Fake-news in Chinese showing some English text;
- Fixed: Text Issues;
- Fixed: Subscriber display bug;
- Fixed: Desync draw cheap in MP;
- Fixed: MP bug for nukes;
- Fixed: Trojan Destroyers having no effect on Neurax Worm;
- Fixed active abilities custom icon issue;
- Fixed possible cheat method;
- Fixes to help Steam high score tables.

[b]Mac Users on 32bit Mac / macOS 10.6 Snow Leopard Changes[/b]
As Apple are deprecating 32bit applications, we're moving a playable 32bit version of Plague Inc: Evolved to its own branch for those players still using it. ([url=https://support.apple.com/downloads/macos]We recommend upgrading to 64bit if possible[/url]). 

[b]How to change branches[/b]
To access the 'macos32bit' branch:
Click on Plague Inc: Evolved > Right Click > Proprieties > Betas > From the drop down list choose "macos32bit - Legacy OSX 32 bit build".

Stay safe!
Ndemic Creations Team
